# Real trace — C4 CPU frequency / compute-supply evidence (VS-2 lane)
#
# Ground truth (PROFILE.md §1.3): cpu_frequency samples exist ONLY for cpus
# 3-5 (30 each, shared 11-step ladder 807000..2189000 kHz; jump to 2189000
# at 34579.470347); cpus 0-2 have zero frequency samples in this capture;
# the frequency-limits lane is absent (0 events). Honest answer names the
# governed cpus and the range, and states that not all cpus have frequency
# samples instead of extrapolating.
ID="real_trace_c4_freq_supply_evidence"
NAME="real trace — frequency evidence per cpu honesty"
QUESTION="只分析这份 trace，不分析代码。这份 trace 里有哪些 CPU 频率方面的证据？哪些核上有频率采样，频率范围多大？是不是所有核都有频率数据？"
HTRACE_FILE="eval/fixtures/real_traces/donghu_tieba_frame.systrace"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(2189000|2\\.189 ?GHz|2\\.19 ?GHz|2189 ?MHz)
(807000|807 ?MHz|0\\.807 ?GHz)
(cpu|CPU|核).{0,3}3"
EXPECT_MATCHES_TEXT_REGEX="(没有|未|无|缺少|不是所有|并非所有|只有|仅).{0,40}(频率|frequency|采样|样本)|(频率|frequency|采样|样本).{0,40}(没有|未见|缺少|只覆盖|只有|仅)"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="still_present not_enough_evidence"
EXPECT_LOG_MATCHES_REGEX="phase=toolcall .*tool=trace_query"
